    {
      "id": "claim_3f4b207858a840d38563ac5f7d5caac7",
      "statement": "The 10-minute timeout bounds each individual shell command, not the agent run as a whole; the overall run has no timeout of its own and is bounded only by the cancellation token passed down from the job queue.",
