        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e9e4502bf47d401e88753eddd8f7005e",
      "statement": "A run publishes no artifacts: after RunAsync, ImplementSpec reads the worktree's short git status and emits one LogCompleted information message interpolating repository, issue number, worktree path, status, and the agent's full response text; there is no commit, push, pull request, or written output, so the uncommitted worktree is the only result.",
