    {
      "id": "claim_2715239169de4064a305e49461d89981",
      "statement": "AgentRoleTests pins the configuration envelope rather than agent behavior: CreateOptionsUsesConfigure proves a derived role's Name and Instructions flow through Configure, and ImplementationAgentConfiguresFileAccessAndShell asserts a non-null FileAccessStore, DisableWriteTools left false, exactly one AIContextProvider, and exactly one tool — so an accidental hardening that disables writes or drops the shell fails the suite.",
